    <string name="shizuku_help_step1">1. Make sure Shizuku is running: open Shizuku app, home shows "Running".</string>
    <string name="shizuku_help_step2">2. Verify this app is installed: run pm list packages | grep ai.android in a terminal.</string>
    <string name="shizuku_help_step3">3. Shizuku must be ≥ v13 (API_V23 permission). Old v11.x uses API_VXX and won\'t recognize this app.</string>
    <string name="shizuku_help_step4">4. Kill and restart Shizuku: swipe it away from recents, reopen Shizuku → authorization list refreshes.</string>
    <string name="shizuku_help_more">If still not visible: use "Add manually" in Shizuku, or upgrade Shizuku to v13.1.5+.</string>
